Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.02,0:00:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,LADY LINDBURG!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt? No, I managed to make\Nit. I'm so terribly sorry. It's my
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.46,0:00:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mistake i should have come with you\Nm 'lady there's no point in having an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.82,0:00:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,escort during my trials for the\Nright to the throne i'm the one who
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,insisted on that you are not at fault\Ninez i'm sorry i didn't mean to make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.94,0:00:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.86,0:00:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Lindbergh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.86,0:00:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Darkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.24,0:00:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us return to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Rain would
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.24,0:00:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like to speak with you\Nas soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.88,0:00:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've spoken with Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.34,0:02:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.74,0:02:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was a Minotaur actually summoned\Nto a city full of people?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It resides in the abyss, the\Ndeepest parts of the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no doubt, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.12,0:02:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, this is the\Nwork of someone's intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.94,0:02:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The source of the summon is\Nthought to be a mysterious
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.18,0:02:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ring found on the corpse of a\Nmerchant lying at the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.60,0:02:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Oaken did his research,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.32,0:02:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he found the magic stone in the ring\Nis of a surprisingly high purity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.32,0:03:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is not something that you\Nwould normally find on the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.44,0:03:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Minotaurs are a threat A-level demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normal people cannot simply just buy\Nsomething to trap a creature like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.40,0:03:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to what Okun\Nsays the crest left on
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.12,0:03:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the stone indicates the\Nring originates from.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The magic empire of Doritas, of\Ncourse, it was Doritas he has often
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.82,0:03:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,provoked us but it's Different\Nthis time right he tried to ensure
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.96,0:03:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would work by binding the\Nprincess at the time Of the summon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plus he isn't even trying to get\Nrid of the evidence it's troubling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A plot to assassinate Princess Lindbergh\Nis bad enough, but there seems to be more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.26,0:03:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was waiting for us to initiate a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.94,0:03:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems they want nothing\Nmore than to take what is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our kingdom's prized resource, the\Nrelics of the Dungeon of the Lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, about the man who\Nwas able to save Lind's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a single broadsword.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in only a few seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.94,0:04:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he defeated a minotaur.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.94,0:04:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, the secret core followed\Nhis movements but lost sight of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said he disappeared before their\Nvery eyes like some sort of an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.50,0:04:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.84,0:04:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who is this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.04,0:04:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.96,0:04:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You survived!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.98,0:04:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Survived what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.22,0:04:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't act like you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last night, a giant demon appeared\Nnear the entrance of the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a beast like nothing\Nwe've ever seen around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.46,0:04:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was over by the construction site.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.44,0:04:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since we didn't see you come\Nby after work, I got worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last night, I was being followed\Naround by a shady group of characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I ducked and hid and went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why is your face dirty?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.86,0:05:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I still had to clean\Nthe mud out of the drains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.18,0:05:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're real lucky you didn't bump into\Nthat thing while you were out last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.50,0:05:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to be an A-rank myself, and if\NI came across it, I'd be dead for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the demon was\Nreally something awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.42,0:05:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure glad I only had to\Ndeal with a surly cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, what happened to the demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, seems it was taken down by\Na mystery man with a broadsword,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,apparently in one blow, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.66,0:05:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing there are people\Nout there who take care of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.28,0:05:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, your payment for yesterday's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, are you still not trying\Nto get yourself a decent job?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A decent job?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm already working as\Nan adventurer, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.16,0:05:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Nor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.14,0:06:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep telling you, you\Ncould earn 30 % more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.36,0:06:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need me taking\Na cut of your cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.38,0:06:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have found you. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At long last.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.14,0:06:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're from last night? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.84,0:06:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for following you\Naround, but I needed to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I used my long-distance detection\Nskill to find out where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.08,0:06:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've heard of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.48,0:06:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then your job class is listed as thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.06,0:06:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, my focus is the magician class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.04,0:06:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I also have some knowledge\Nof all six skill systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all just at a basic level, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually so basic, it's\Nembarrassing telling you about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that him? Can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.22,0:06:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got an audience here, so\Nwould you mind speaking outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.94,0:06:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do, Nor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.80,0:06:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least nothing that I can\Nthink of to get me in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:06:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There shouldn't be too\Nmany folks out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And plus,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.96,0:07:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my sound-clooping and concealment skill\Ncan keep people from eavesdropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.94,0:07:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I go with her, or what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out there, so that you don't\Nmake any more dumb mistakes. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.30,0:07:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not sure what you mean, but all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.12,0:07:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, are we sure that guy actually exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.66,0:07:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Secret Corps couldn't\Nfind him, how are we supposed to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.70,0:07:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like they might\Nbe looking for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do apologize for just\Nshowing up out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.18,0:07:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have confronted you while\Nyou were speaking with the Guildmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.18,0:07:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.20,0:07:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what is it that I can help you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to properly give you my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I truly appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.84,0:07:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved my very life last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.84,0:08:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's not just because\Nyou saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.74,0:08:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you did amounts to saving the\Nlives of many others in this nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your skills are far more\Nimpressive than mine could ever be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I think I may\Nhave just gotten in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.16,0:08:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is simply not true. I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine what would have happened\Nto me if you had not rushed to my defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.38,0:08:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, then I humbly accept\Nyour thanks. Personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.28,0:08:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am obligated to give\Nyou as much of a reward as
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.96,0:08:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,possible for your assistance\Nwith what happened last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to greatly compensate\Nyou with my deepest gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.64,0:08:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, your gratitude has\Nalready been more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.96,0:08:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So can we maybe just\Ncall everything square?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.72,0:08:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.78,0:08:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let me thank you properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My father has also asked to meet you so\Nhe can give you his full appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's\Ngoing to be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may not look it, but\NI'm a person of status.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must give something to the\Nperson who I owe my very life to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.98,0:08:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.86,0:09:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there must be something that\Nyou're having trouble with, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.42,0:09:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing that I can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you need, I can even talk to my\Nfather about some territory that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.02,0:09:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.24,0:09:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.88,0:09:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.24,0:09:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.26,0:09:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have an obligation to\Naccept my gratitude! I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.82,0:09:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not move an inch until you\Nare willing to accept my gratitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not leave this spot until\Nyou agree to train me in your art!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, look, if I agree to meet with\Nyour father, will that be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.56,0:09:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great! That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.40,0:09:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no need for\Nanything extravagant, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.84,0:09:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now then, if you'd be so kind, please\Nfollow close behind me. Oh, right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want people to\Nspot us going inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'll use my concealment detection\Nocclusion and multiple others to hide us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.32,0:10:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this place is massive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.64,0:10:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.26,0:10:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.14,0:10:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may seem a bit ostentatious\Nand everything, but come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I think of it, I'm afraid you\Nstill haven't told me what your name is yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.68,0:10:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I'm Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.58,0:10:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you, Lord Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.24,0:10:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.30,0:10:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My full apologies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.02,0:10:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I completely forgot to introduce myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.70,0:10:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Lindbergh Clays at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.46,0:10:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my full title can be a little\Ncumbersome and pretentious,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.54,0:11:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I just go by Lind for the most part.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.86,0:11:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you can feel free to just\Nuse that whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.02,0:11:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, this is really a spacious house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She must be one of those\Nfancy aristocrats or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.58,0:11:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that you don't make\Nany more dumb mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.74,0:11:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this what he meant?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.14,0:11:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.22,0:11:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.14,0:11:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can ask her where\Nmy father is right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome back home, Lady Lindbergh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.74,0:11:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Ines.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to speak\Nwith my father, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is currently in the audience\Nchamber speaking with Rain, m 'lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this man with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.18,0:11:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man is my honored guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the one who risked his life to\Nsave mine in that attack last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.94,0:11:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are in your debt. Follow\Nme. I'll lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She must be the maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.76,0:11:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta be hard to do laundry\Nand dishes in that outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:12:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She might want to rethink that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.38,0:12:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, she seems super suspicious of me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Ines?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.46,0:12:21.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why is Lindbergh with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.80,0:12:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I like this place
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.56,0:12:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who might this man be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.90,0:12:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.18,0:12:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This person is an honored guest\Nof Lady Lindbergh. Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.06,0:12:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only guess if you're\Nhere with Lady Lindbergh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.70,0:12:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you're the one we've\Nall been talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.66,0:12:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.80,0:12:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure don't look\Nlike very much, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop being a nuisance, Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.14,0:12:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, come along with us to the chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:12:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more escorts, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.10,0:13:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay, I'll go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.18,0:13:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doritis is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.06,0:13:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't give a damn about the\Nnon-aggression treaty nor resolving anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.08,0:13:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His previous request made that obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to hand over all\Nthe rights to the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.10,0:13:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were to lend you my\NEmpire's military power,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.22,0:13:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it shall be beneficial for you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate such a candid offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'd like to avoid the type of proposal
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.08,0:13:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that could result in\Nlosing my entire nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There will come a day in your future\Nwhen you shall regret those words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.14,0:13:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, that might not be the\Nonly looming threat for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.46,0:13:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the time has finally come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.18,0:13:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.80,0:13:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, sister. Hello, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lin
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.68,0:14:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lin's father lin that is the hermit's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cloak don't tell me you went back\Noutside the castle again i needed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.56,0:14:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to go find the person who saved my\Nlife myself no matter what mmm this
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,must be him yes This is the one who\Nshowed up and rescued me last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.20,0:14:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for just showing up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lin here seemed to be in quite the hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.56,0:14:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How you address does not matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do thank you for making\Nthe long journey here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.68,0:14:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you know, I'm not like wealthy\Nor royalty or anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know all the etiquette and so\NI'm probably going to do things wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sorry in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.54,0:14:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, I prefer\Nto have a real conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.56,0:14:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And first, I would like to\Nformally show my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without your heroic actions,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.46,0:15:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my beloved daughter would be\Ngone forever from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.30,0:15:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply cannot thank you enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.56,0:15:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're welcome, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.00,0:15:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was my honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.94,0:15:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a blessing to get to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.54,0:15:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, gratitude accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.76,0:15:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to hit the bathhouse and head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.12,0:15:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nonetheless, I cannot send her savior\Naway without some sort of reward. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.20,0:15:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you'd like,\Nwhether it be land or money.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It matters not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.42,0:15:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ask and it shall be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it you desire, friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't want anything,\Nbut thank you. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.66,0:15:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.44,0:15:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you have no need for money\Nnor land, do you? Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.68,0:15:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about the treasures from the dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.24,0:15:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our country takes great pride in\Npossessing the world's oldest dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.04,0:15:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All manner of rarities have been unearthed\Nand are stored within the treasure hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.52,0:15:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can walk through our collection of\Npriceless relics and take whatever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:16:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is far too generous, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.74,0:16:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want any of that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.76,0:16:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I don't need any sort\Nof gifts at all, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.98,0:16:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you have already\Ngranted is more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.40,0:16:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, no treasures either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see then, what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.62,0:16:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a sword? Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.60,0:16:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sword it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it doesn't look\Nlike much at first glance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.62,0:16:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine, Rain. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point, I'm afraid it has become\Nnothing more than a mere decoration.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is far better than just\Nletting it sit here unused.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.88,0:16:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.08,0:16:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.82,0:16:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one will even notice if I\Nswitch it out for the replica.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.64,0:17:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dang, it's super heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.96,0:17:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure this must be a\Nfamily heirloom or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could never accept this from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply stumbled upon\Nit while on a journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.84,0:17:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even remember where.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just found it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's basically a hand-me-down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.76,0:17:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you at least accept that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.42,0:17:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will make me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I graciously accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.40,0:17:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like to give\Nit a nice, solid swing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.98,0:17:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.76,0:17:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Physical enhancements.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.68,0:17:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.72,0:17:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is heavy, but not so\Nmuch that I can't swing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.10,0:17:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can wield it one-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you a strong, sturdy young man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.70,0:18:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is very kind of you, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.08,0:18:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, about my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.76,0:18:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like you to teach her some\Nthings, toughen her up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.86,0:18:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are getting perilous out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.72,0:18:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm rather worried about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.16,0:18:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gosh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can\Nteach her, and anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.40,0:18:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's something she should\Nyou know decide on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When parents meddle too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.62,0:18:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their kids kind of tend to\Nhead in the opposite direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.20,0:18:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.66,0:18:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sure does laugh a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.10,0:18:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I better hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.66,0:18:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.58,0:18:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate your time, good sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.28,0:18:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as Lin's father, I\Nhumbly thank you once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The heft would be great for training,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.84,0:18:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I kind of feel like I\Nwas given something valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah. Wait a sec. This sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.90,0:19:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about the same width as the\Ndrain by Auntie Stella's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.36,0:19:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be great for dredging\Nthe muck out of the sewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.00,0:19:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try it first thing\Ntomorrow. Sir! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.08,0:19:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.60,0:19:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I won't take\Nmuch more of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.90,0:19:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does she want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.20,0:19:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First of all, I'd like to\Napologize for my behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.28,0:19:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My conduct was not appropriate towards the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.44,0:19:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,very person who saved\NLady Lindbergh's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.08,0:19:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to ask you\Nfor your forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.58,0:19:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.68,0:19:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And please, you should stand up, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for accepting my apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.46,0:19:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is my sworn duty to\Nprotect the people of the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clays family from all\Ndangers they may encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.74,0:19:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you should understand that said duty
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.86,0:19:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,always takes precedence\Nover how I treat guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.48,0:19:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you are not Lin's\Nmaid, after all, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.20,0:19:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.60,0:19:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.54,0:20:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Ines Harness, a member of the\NWarrior Corps for the Claes family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.20,0:20:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I serve as Vice Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.98,0:20:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like she's a big shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.46,0:20:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From very early in my childhood,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.60,0:20:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have been known as the Divine Shield,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as I was appointed as the personal\Nroyal guard of Lady Lindbergh's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.62,0:20:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, that means I am the one\Nwho must protect my lady at all costs,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.74,0:20:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if it forfeits my own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since you are the\Nperson who saved her life,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.66,0:20:26.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is as though you saved my life as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything all that major.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.48,0:20:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.40,0:20:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From here on, I shall help\Nyou in every way possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.96,0:20:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you need my assistance\Nwith anything, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.70,0:20:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These people are really overdoing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.26,0:20:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, it's all a bit too\Nmuch for me, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.74,0:20:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything comes up, I'll ask for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But let me warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.18,0:20:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Lindbergh may have allowed your\Nattitude, demeanor, your speech and behavior,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.68,0:20:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All unpardonable while in\Naudience with the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.64,0:20:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are not permitted to take\Non such a familiar manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.64,0:21:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.56,0:21:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should you continue as such, I will no\Nlonger be able to overlook your disrespect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.28,0:21:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get yourself together, especially\Nin front of the retainers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.72,0:21:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I do appreciate the warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.52,0:21:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.44,0:21:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's all I really\Nwanted to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.72,0:21:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, to whom is it that I\Nfind myself so deeply indebted?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.42,0:21:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to have your\Nname, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.68,0:21:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.84,0:21:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.16,0:21:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, did I do something wrong again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.38,0:21:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.28,0:21:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon, I must be taking my leave. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.78,0:21:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, I ticked her off again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.82,0:21:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is our illustrious hero\Nalready heading home?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.10,0:21:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's... he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.50,0:21:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.26,0:21:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.18,0:21:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have heard of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Gilbert.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.24,0:21:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't you join me for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like you to show me\Nthese wonderful talents of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.80,0:22:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to go home.

